{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle combat shooter with roguelike progression, customization, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/efce4f02b5ee2e605bff04e871e1c292.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/efce4f02b5ee2e605bff04e871e1c292.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/efce4f02b5ee2e605bff04e871e1c292.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Targeting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take advantage of the Dead Aim system for precision targeting, disabling and stopping the opposition in their tracks. No roadside assistance is coming to the rescue.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/455fec45993c66a82d1a2e34caabcf02.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/455fec45993c66a82d1a2e34caabcf02.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/455fec45993c66a82d1a2e34caabcf02.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/649b272578d7c231124f4b937baabb88.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/649b272578d7c231124f4b937baabb88.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/649b272578d7c231124f4b937baabb88.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Throttle Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both Vehicles and their Drivers have unique Active and Passive abilities that fundamentally alter the way you play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/92a438d2328423bf797c0680822d18e9.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/92a438d2328423bf797c0680822d18e9.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/92a438d2328423bf797c0680822d18e9.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Terrain Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The environment and seasonal shifts impact vehicle and weapon performance, adding a unique tactical element to the genre.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/856a7277982234f8f3d25d67aa1efcbd.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/856a7277982234f8f3d25d67aa1efcbd.gif?t=1759429835\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*With GPU and CPU performance in mind, precalculated physics interactions  reduce your gaming device's real-time hardware demand.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real physics interactions allow for hundreds of unique explosions and cinematic fatalities.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/25d2ddd456791c6b11813b58bbd192b9.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/25d2ddd456791c6b11813b58bbd192b9.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/25d2ddd456791c6b11813b58bbd192b9.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural FX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet holes, scorch marks, and dirt accumulation varies based on the impacted material.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/92f0fab2c7c909cdeaa6f2d8e28cb55c.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/92f0fab2c7c909cdeaa6f2d8e28cb55c.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/92f0fab2c7c909cdeaa6f2d8e28cb55c.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights!?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell yeah we've got Boss Fights. Compete in 5-minute deathmatches that culminate in a challenging confrontation or progress through open-world realms and defeat the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/c6fb5961be6a5f0fad1527dd3808b27c.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/c6fb5961be6a5f0fad1527dd3808b27c.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/c6fb5961be6a5f0fad1527dd3808b27c.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supercharged Augments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and equip powerful augments like Lightning Ammo that deals electric damage and bounces to nearby targets.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock, equip, and upgrade components to enhance vehicle performance. Obtain powerful vehicle and weapon augments hidden throughout the battlefield.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apply skins, paints, and decals to make it yours.\u00a0More importantly:\u00a0Stay Metal\u00a0\ud83e\udd18\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/bfe80b5235c55ace2b1bd7f55817c68f.avif?t=1759429835\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FAQ</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Will this be released for consoles?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > PC, PS5, and Xbox. Steam Deck and Switch 2 are unconfirmed at this time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>When can I try it?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Demo is available now for Windows PC.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Will it have gamepad and wheel support?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes and yes. However, early builds of the Demo may not have full controller and wheel support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Linux, MacOS, Steam Deck, Switch?</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be confirmed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3068230?t=1759429835","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/7125a936e05ce7fcf10711a1a0b98f814444c8bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759429835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/c5c7923fd83d824b92e26f410ac0187d1cfaeddd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759429835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/c5c7923fd83d824b92e26f410ac0187d1cfaeddd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759429835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3667330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle combat shooter with roguelike progression, customization, and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/efce4f02b5ee2e605bff04e871e1c292.poster.avif?t=1759429835\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/efce4f02b5ee2e605bff04e871e1c292.webm?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068230/extras/efce4f02b5ee2e605bff04e871e1c292.mp4?t=1759429835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid